{
  "name": "dsh-prompt-dock",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "DSH 提示词修改助手：挂在输入框工具行（conversation.input.right，模型选择左侧），对草稿做 AI 改写（简洁/详细/结构化/译英/自定义，SSE 流式、可中断、可撤销、随会话上下文）并支持模板一键插入。含 @文件//命令 芯片保护与回填变更检测，改写接口仅限本机回环访问。UI 对齐官方模型选择下拉框。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "permissions": {
      "network": {
        "fetch": false,
        "socket": false,
        "domains": []
      },
      "process": {
        "child_process": true,
        "note": "仅用于「打开配置文件」：调用系统文件管理器定位 profile 的 cordis.patch.yml（explorer.exe / open / xdg-open），不执行任意命令。"
      },
      "filesystem": {
        "read": ["$DSH_HOME/prompt-dock"],
        "write": ["$DSH_HOME/prompt-dock"],
        "note": "仅读写插件自己的旧配置目录：启动时把 settings.json 幂等改名为 settings.json.migrated，并清理过期文件。设置本身存在 profile 的 cordis.patch.yml（由 DSH 官方 configEditor 写入，插件不直接读写它）。"
      },
      "env": {
        "read": ["DSH_HOME", "DSH_PROMPT_DOCK_DISABLE_OPEN"],
        "note": "DSH_HOME 用于定位旧配置目录；DSH_PROMPT_DOCK_DISABLE_OPEN=1 时禁止弹出文件管理器。不读取任何 API key：模型凭据由宿主 llm 服务持有，插件从不接触。"
      }
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.2 <0.3.0 || >=0.2.1-0 <0.3.0",
      "dshReleases": {
        "0.2.0-rc.2": "compatible",
        "0.2.1-rc.2": "compatible"
      }
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.0",
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "deepseek",
    "cordis",
    "prompt",
    "composer",
    "plugin"
  ],
  "author": "wnei-f",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/wnei-f/dsh-prompt-dock.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/wnei-f/dsh-prompt-dock#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/wnei-f/dsh-prompt-dock/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "pretest": "node scripts/link-dsh-deps.mjs",
    "test": "node test/host.test.mjs && node test/client-logic.test.mjs && node test/client-mount.test.mjs"
  }
}
